                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"637\" height=\"184\"><text font-family=\"Segoe UI\" font-size=\"12.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">Subnet the 192.168.5.0/24 network to sufficient addressing  for each LAN (Also,the \npoint-to-point connection between R1 and R2)\n\nAssign the first usable address to PC in each LAN\n\nAssign the last usable address to the Router 's interface in each LAN\n\nCoofigure static routes on each router so that all PC's can ping each other</text></svg>",
